===== NOTE =====
floor() reads MIN.txt and compares a taken total to that integer.
CI used this as a cheap rehearsal when the desk was first wired.
===== SHIFT =====
Nightly clasp has stayed green since the CI floor landed.
Operators still open /app/packbay/latest after incidents and find the
newest populated day file missing even when /app/daywell still holds it.
The floor value lives under floorcue/.
